  m_text: "*Metinden Videoya (Text-to-Video): K\u0131sa metin a\xE7\u0131klamalar\u0131n\u0131
    6 saniyelik HD videolara d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCr.\n\n*G\xF6rselden Videoya
    (Image-to-Video): Y\xFCklenen g\xF6rselleri hareketli videolara \xE7evirir.\n\n*\xC7oklu
    Dil Deste\u011Fi: Farkl\u0131 dillerde i\xE7erik \xFCretimine olanak tan\u0131r.\n\n*H\u0131zl\u0131
    \u0130\u015Flem S\xFCresi: Yakla\u015F\u0131k 30 saniyede video \xFCretimi sa\u011Flar.\n\n*Kullan\u0131c\u0131
    Dostu Aray\xFCz: Teknik bilgi gerektirmeden kolay kullan\u0131m sunar. "
