  m_text: "\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLensGo AI, metin a\xE7\u0131klamalar\u0131 veya g\xF6rsellerden
    y\xFCksek kaliteli g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCler ve videolar olu\u015Fturman\u0131za olanak
