  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\n\xDCcretsiz Plan: \nK\xFC\xE7\xFCk
    veri k\xFCmeleri, temel analiz ara\xE7lar\u0131, s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 i\u015Flem
    kapasitesi.\n\nBasic Plan: \nAyl\u0131k 19$, orta \xF6l\xE7ekli projeler i\xE7in
    analiz deste\u011Fi.\n\nPro Plan: \nAyl\u0131k 59$, y\xFCksek \xE7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCk
    deste\u011Fi, zaman serisi analizi ve \xF6zel modeller.\n\nEnterprise Plan: \n\xD6zel
    fiyatland\u0131rma, s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z veri i\u015Fleme, \xF6ncelikli destek,
    \xF6zel model e\u011Fitimi.\n\n"
