  m_text: "* Video D\xFCzenleyici: Kesme, birle\u015Ftirme, filtre ekleme, h\u0131z
    ayarlama gibi i\u015Flemler i\xE7in kullan\u0131c\u0131 dostu aray\xFCz.\n\n*
    AI Destekli G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC \u0130yile\u015Ftirme: Eski veya d\xFC\u015F\xFCk
    kaliteli foto\u011Fraflar\u0131 netle\u015Ftirme ve b\xFCy\xFCtme.\n\n* Arka
    Plan Kald\u0131rma: G\xF6rsel veya videolardaki arka plan\u0131 otomatik olarak
    silme.\n\n* Video D\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCc\xFC: 1000\u2019den fazla format
    aras\u0131nda h\u0131zl\u0131 ve kay\u0131ps\u0131z d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCrme
    deste\u011Fi.\n\n* Ses ve Video \u0130ndirici: YouTube, TikTok, Instagram gibi
    platformlardan i\xE7erik indirme.\n\n* AI Ses D\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCc\xFC:
    Ger\xE7ek zamanl\u0131 veya kay\u0131tl\u0131 sesleri farkl\u0131 ses profillerine
    d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCrme."
