  m_text: "* Metinden G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC ve Video \xDCretimi: K\u0131sa metin a\xE7\u0131klamalar\u0131yla
    g\xF6rseller ve videolar olu\u015Fturma.\n\n* Stil Transferi: Mevcut g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC
    ve videolara farkl\u0131 sanatsal stiller uygulama.\n\n* \xD6zel Model E\u011Fitimi:
    Kendi g\xF6rsellerinizi kullanarak ki\u015Fisel AI modelleri e\u011Fitme imkan\u0131.\n\n*
    Kullan\u0131c\u0131 Dostu Aray\xFCz: Her seviyeden kullan\u0131c\u0131 i\xE7in
