      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "* Reklam ve Sat\u0131\u015F Metinleri: D\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm odakl\u0131
    ba\u015Fl\u0131klar, a\xE7\u0131klamalar ve \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131lar \xFCretme.\n\n*
    SEO Uyumlu \u0130\xE7erik: Anahtar kelime analizine g\xF6re optimize edilmi\u015F
    blog yaz\u0131lar\u0131 ve \xFCr\xFCn a\xE7\u0131klamalar\u0131.\n\n* \xC7ok
    Dilli \u0130\xE7erik \xDCretimi: 25+ dilde i\xE7erik olu\u015Fturma deste\u011Fi.\n\n*
    Marka Tonu Uyarlama: Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n marka sesi ve tarz\u0131na uygun
    i\xE7erik \xFCretme.\n\n* Ger\xE7ek Zamanl\u0131 D\xFCzenleme: Taslaklar \xFCzerinde
    an\u0131nda revizyon ve \xF6neriler sunma."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
