  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\nFree Plan: \n-G\xFCnl\xFCk
    giri\u015F i\xE7in bonus kredileri\r\n-S\u0131rada 3 g\xF6reve kadar\n\nStandard
    Plan:\n Y\u0131l\t\u0131k 107.99$, \n-1000 ayl\u0131k kredi\r\n-G\xFCnl\xFCk
    giri\u015F i\xE7in bonus kredileri\r\n-H\u0131zl\u0131 \xFCretim\r\n-S\u0131rada
    5 g\xF6reve kadar\r\n-2 g\xF6revi ayn\u0131 anda i\u015Fleyin\r\n-Filigranlar\u0131
    kald\u0131r\r\n-Yeni \xF6zelliklere \xF6ncelikli eri\u015Fim\n\nPro Plan: \nY\u0131ll\u0131k
    377.99$, 4500 ayl\u0131k kredi\r\n-G\xFCnl\xFCk giri\u015F i\xE7in bonus kredileri\r\n-H\u0131zl\u0131
    \xFCretim\r\n-S\u0131rada 5 g\xF6reve kadar\r\n-2 g\xF6revi ayn\u0131 anda i\u015Fleyin\r\n-Filigranlar\u0131
    kald\u0131r\r\n-Yeni \xF6zelliklere \xF6ncelikli eri\u015Fim\n\nS\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z
    Plan: \n-Y\u0131ll\u0131k Plan 1179.99$\nY\u0131"
