  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\n\xDCcretsiz Plan: \nFiligranl\u0131
    i\xE7erik, s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 d\xFCzenleme ara\xE7lar\u0131.\n\nMonthly Plan:
    \nAyl\u0131k 19.95$, tam ara\xE7 eri\u015Fimi, HD d\u0131\u015Fa aktarma.\n\nAnnual
    Plan: \nY\u0131ll\u0131k 79.95$, t\xFCm \xF6zelliklere eri\u015Fim, \xFCcretsiz
    g\xFCncellemeler.\n\nPerpetual Plan: \nTek seferlik 99.95$, \xF6m\xFCr boyu kullan\u0131m,
    s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 g\xFCncelleme hakk\u0131"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
