  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\n\xDCcretsiz Plan: \nAyl\u0131k
    200 kredi, s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 g\xF6rev kuyru\u011Fu, payla\u015F\u0131lan
    sunucu, topluluk deste\u011Fi.\n\nPro Plan: \nAyl\u0131k 16$, 1.000 kredi, h\u0131zl\u0131
    \xF6zel sunucu, \xF6zel varl\u0131klar, API eri\u015Fimi.\n\nMax Plan: \nAyl\u0131k
    48$, 4.000 kredi, \xF6ncelikli destek, geli\u015Fmi\u015F \xF6zellikler.\n\nEnterprise
    Plan: \n\xD6zelle\u015Ftirilmi\u015F \xE7\xF6z\xFCmler ve \xF6zel fiyatland\u0131rma
    i\xE7in ileti\u015Fime ge\xE7ilmesi gerekiyor."
