  m_text: "\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCopyCopter AI, yarat\u0131c\u0131 metin yazarl\u0131\u011F\u0131,
    reklam metni \xFCretimi ve i\xE7erik pazarlamas\u0131 i\xE7in \xF6zel olarak
    geli\u015Ftirilmi\u015F yapay zeka tabanl\u0131 bir yaz\u0131m asistan\u0131d\u0131r.
    Hedef odakl\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 ve etkili metinler olu\u015Fturarak markalar\u0131n
    i\xE7erik \xFCretimini h\u0131zland\u0131r\u0131r ve kaliteyi art\u0131r\u0131r.\n"
