  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\n\xDCcretsiz Plan: \nS\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131
    \xF6zellikler, d\xFC\u015F\xFCk \xE7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCkte videolar.\n\nBasic
    Plan: \nAyl\u0131k 10$, dakikada 1 video, s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 dil se\xE7enekleri.\n\nPro
    Plan:\n Ayl\u0131k 39$, daha uzun videolar, y\xFCz de\u011Fi\u015Ftirme ve dublaj
    \xF6zellikleri.\n\nEnterprise Plan:\n \xD6zel fiyatland\u0131rma, s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z
    kullan\u0131m, API eri\u015Fimi ve \xF6zel destek."
